    "Your three-hour calendar, food totals, workout and sleep together. Tap to open the full overview.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Your three-hour calendar, food totals, workout and sleep together. Tap to open the full overview."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Drei Stunden Kalender, Ernährung, Training und Schlaf zusammen. Tippen für die vollständige Übersicht."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tu calendario de tres horas, comida, entrenamiento y sueño juntos. Toca para abrir el resumen completo."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Votre calendrier sur trois heures, alimentation, entraînement et sommeil. Touchez pour ouvrir la vue complète."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Calendario di tre ore, cibo, allenamento e sonno insieme. Tocca per aprire il riepilogo completo."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Trzy godziny kalendarza, jedzenie, trening i sen razem. Stuknij, aby otworzyć pełny widok."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Calendário de três horas, alimentação, treino e sono juntos. Toque para abrir o resumo completo."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Календарь на три часа, питание, тренировка и сон вместе. Нажмите для полного обзора."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"三小时日程、饮食总量、训练和睡眠一目了然。轻点打开完整概览。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"三小時行程、飲食總量、訓練和睡眠一目瞭然。點一下打開完整概覽。"}}}},
